# Telegram Omni — production memory

## Live site
- Public HTTPS: `https://basictrickhub.com`
- Admin: `https://basictrickhub.com/admin/telegram`
- Admin password env: `ADMIN_PASSWORD` (default `basictrick-admin`)
- Webhook path: `/api/telegram/webhook?secret=<webhookSecret from data/telegram-bot.json>`

## Admins (Telegram user IDs)
- `5311644406`
- `7967023275`

## Secrets (NEVER commit to GitHub)
- Bot token lives only in VPS `data/telegram-bot.json` (or Admin → Connect UI)
- Do not paste bot tokens into repo files, `.env.example`, or commits
- If a token was exposed in chat, rotate via @BotFather `/revoke`

## Groups / channels
- Admin → **Groups** tab: paste `https://t.me/...`, `@username`, chat id, or invite link
- Private invites stay Pending until the bot is added as admin, then Sync / my_chat_member activates them

## Deploy
- Repo: `https://github.com/abexpoit-blip/basictrickhub`
- VPS app: `/var/www/basictrickhub`, PM2 `basictrickhub`, port `3017`
- Nginx Docker proxy target: `http://172.17.0.1:3017`
